    "Repair-turn workload (ADR-063 Q4-QWEN36, operator decision 2026-11-03): the client runs --repair-turns 1 (qwen38_n1_verdict.Workflow). After a failed run_tests the agent gets exactly one repair cycle: one more write_file src/ports.rs, then run_tests on the same target; the six steps then resume. A second failed run_tests fails the agent. Prompts, tools, templates, sampling, budgets and every other step are canonical, and the approval binds repair_turns 1. Qwen3.6 only (q5_case.REPAIR_FAMILIES), on the hf2q-converted GGUF (MODEL_SHA256 815a22ca...), identical on hf2q and the peer.",
